cording from audio devices, real or virtual.\n- Support for importing from and exporting to a wide range of audio formats, extensible with FFmpeg.\n- High quality audio processing, including up to 32-bit float audio support.\n- Extensibility with support for plug-ins, providing support for VST 2, LADSPA/LV2, and AU plugins.\n- Support for scripting in the built-in scripting language Nyquist, or in Python, Perl, and other languages with named pipes.\n- Editing arbitrary sampling and multi-track timeline.\n- Accessibility including editing via keyboard, screen reader support and narration support.\n- Tools useful in the analysis of signals, including audio.\nTenacity does not have a single application when it comes to audio processing. Musicians recording real instruments can make a song in Tenacity, podcasters can edit their episodes in Tenacity, and even academic researchers can analyze signals using Tenacity. We don’t intend to focus Tenacity on a single area of audio processing, but rather, we intend to focus Tenacity over audio processing in general, including the aforementioned applications.","moniker":"tenacity","name":"Tenacity","packageUrl":"https://codeberg.org/tenacityteam/tenacity","publisher":"Tenacity Team","publisherUrl":"https://tenacityaudio.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://codeberg.org/tenacityteam/tenacity/releases/tag/v1.3.4","tags":["audio","editor"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一款简单易用、跨平台的多轨音频编辑/录音工具。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Tenacity 是一个免费的开源音频编辑器，从广受欢迎的音频编辑器 Audacity 分支而来。Tenacity 采用 GNU 通用公共许可证第 2 版或更高版本授权。它具有以下功能：\n- 从真实或虚拟的音频设备录音。\n- 支持导入和导出多种音频格式，可通过 FFmpeg 扩展。\n- 高质量音频处理，支持高达 32 位浮点音频。\n- 可扩展性支持插件，包括 VST 2、LADSPA/LV2 和 AU 插件。\n- 支持使用内置脚本语言 Nyquist，或通过命名管道使用 Python、Perl 等语言进行脚本编写。\n- 编辑任意采样和多轨时间线。\n- 无障碍功能，包括通过键盘编辑、屏幕阅读器支持和旁白支持。\n- 用于信号（包括音频）分析的实用工具。\nTenacity 在音频处理方面并没有单一的应用方向。音乐人可以使用 Tenacity 录制真实乐器并制作歌曲，播客制作者可以在 Tenacity 中编辑他们的节目，甚至学术研究人员也可以使用 Tenacity 分析信号。我们并不打算将 Tenacity 专注于音频处理的某一个领域，而是希望它能涵盖广泛的音频处理需求，包括上述各种应用。","tags":["编辑器","音频"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://tenacityaudio.org/","releaseDate":"2026-07-05","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://codeberg.org/tenacityteam/tenacity/releases/tag/v1.3.4","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/t/TenacityTeam/Tenacity/1.3.5/TenacityTeam.Tenacity.yaml","sha256":"fbbf636636d1e7aefed7ae3ad21cfbe9fcf769c4e71b45b0aafacd2f4418526b"},{"path":"manifests/t/TenacityTeam/Tenacity/1.3.5/TenacityTeam.Tenacity.installer.yaml","sha256":"844c4205b2094753b8f79e2ee1ae420bbc185d031dcbe0ba4998a105776329ac"},{"path":"manifests/t/TenacityTeam/Tenacity/1.3.5/TenacityTeam.Tenacity.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"492db168effe5dc0358ca7e1ebf65a0c25626329a2137667b7a57ee8e7fd7beb"},{"path":"manifests/t/TenacityTeam/Tenacity/1.3.5/TenacityTeam.Tenacity.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"c1233e0abc6a0549f4b7f8e91b3cadbf4040b5da37edccfa4d29dea86d30ddbb"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"1.3.5"}